1 NOTE One of the claimants to the throne of Castile and Leon, he waged three 
2 CONT disastrous wars from 1370 to 1382 against that realm. Ferdinand's reign 
2 CONT otherwise was notable for wise legislation designed to advance agriculture 
2 CONT and navigation. Because he left no male issue, his death precipitated a 
2 CONT civil war in which his illegitimate half brother, John I, seized the 
2 CONT throne of Portugal.
