2 CONT =========================================
2 CONT  General Alcibiades Cabral (her father) → Francisca Leopoldina Xavier de Azambuja (his mother) → Sebastião Xavier de Azambuja (her father) → Antônio Xavier de Azambuja (his father) → Francisco Xavier de Azambuja (his father) → Fra
2 CONC ncisca de Oliveira Leite Azambuja (his mother) → Maria de Oliveira Leitão (her mother) → Domingos de Oliveira Leitão (her father) → Genebra Leitão de Vasconcelos (his mother) → Isabel Leitão de Vasconcelos (her mother) → Gonçalo V
2 CONC az Leitão (her father) → Pedro Vaz Leitão (his father) → Vasco Martins Leitão (his father) → Dna. Briolanja de Góis (his mother) → Catarina Vasques de Góis (her mother) → Pedro de Góis, 11.º Sr. de Góis (her father) → Estevão Vasq
2 CONC ues de Góis, alcaide-mór de Lisboa (his father) → Brites de Gois (his sister) → Sancho Álvares Rangel (her son) → Afonso Álvares Rangel, Senhor da Honra de Farinha Podre (his son) → Pedro Álvares Rangel, Senhor da Casa de Rangel (
2 CONC his son) → Diogo Dias Rangel de Macedo, Senhor da Casa de Rangel (his son)
2 CONT → Damião Dias Rangel (his son) → Cosme Rangel de Macedo, Desembargador
