2 CONT
2 CONT Senhorinha Rodrigues de Figueiredo ca 1355-  casada com Gomes Lourenço de Almada 1350.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT 1st lady of Açurara. She is a cousin of the Constable of Portugal Nuno Alvares Pereira, winner of the castellans in the battle of Aljubarrota in 1385, who in turn was ancestor of the Reina Da.Isabel La Católica.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Aires Gonçalves de Figueiredo ca 1325-, married in 1400 to Leonor Pereira ca 1390.
2 CONT
2 CONT D. Gonçalo de Figueiredo, Bishop of Viseu ca 1326-1375, married (?) in 1350 with Sancha Gonçalves de Leiria.
2 CONT
2 CONT Diogo Afonso de Figueiredo.
2 CONT
2 CONT Izabel de Figueiredo ca 1350- married to Lopo Mendes de Vasconcelos 1350-.
2 CONT
