1 NOTE Theoretical daughter of Sotomayor. Ponce de Leon was bound by promise to take care of this child. She was sent to Spain and money was sent to provide for her needs. Legends and stories that are retold over and over again have a wa
2 CONC y of taking on little facets of embellishment. What if this person described as a duaghter were in fact the daughter of Aguebana herself? Legend has her dying a death that was full of grief. What if she were in fact sent to Spain 
2 CONC and provided all she would ever need for the rest of her life out of gratitude for saving the lives of the other Spaniards who were left on the island from a devastating surprise attack? What if she had returned to Puerto Rico at 
2 CONC a much later time, gotten married and continued the bloodline of the Sotomayor? By then the Taino would have been subjugated beyond returning to their former selves. So many questions. So few answers.
2 CONT Just a thought. John Ayes.
