2 CONC ses (born Fernandez De Saavedra De Lima) Siblings: ...eneses Raposo, Rodrigo Gonzalez De Meneses Raposo, Beatriz (Brites) Pires Da Novoa (born Goncalves Raposo), Maria De Meneses, Beatriz De ... Wife: Berenguela Martins Tellez De 
