2 CONT
2 CONT ^ Anthony (1931) states that she was the fourth-born daughter of King Charles III of Navarre by Queen Eleanor, and she was preceded by Juana, Maria and Margarita and the two latter died early. Anthony defines Blanca's exact birth 
2 CONC date as 6 July 1387 by virtue of contemporary sources. 
