2 CONT ========================
2 CONT Fernando IV de Castilla y León, el Emplazado (Sevilla, 1285 - Jaén, 1312)
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ferdinand_IV_of_Castile
2 CONT * https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fernando_IV_de_Le%C3%A3o_e_Castela
