0 @N6000000002322298887@ NOTE Noted for his patronage of voyages of discovery among the Madeira Islands and
1 CONT along the western coast of Africa. Under his auspices, the sailing vessel
1 CONT known as the Portuguese caravel was developed, the techniques of cartography
1 CONT were advanced, navigational instruments were improved, and commerce by sea
1 CONT was vastly stimulated. He was also the designer of a grand strategy -- not to
1 CONT be brought to fulfillment 'til after his death--whereby Christian Europe
1 CONT outflanked the power of Islam by contacts with southern Africa and with Asia.
