1 CONT [edit] Marriages and descendants
1 CONT
1 CONT John I married at Oporto on February 2, 1387 Philippa of Lancaster, daughter of John of Gaunt, 1st Duke of Lancaster and Blanche of Lancaster. From that marriage were born several famous princes and princesses of Portugal (Infante
1 CONC s) that became known as the Illustrious Generation (Portuguese: Ínclita Geração).
