0 @N6000000002188376849@ NOTE Blanche I of Navarre
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Blanche I
1 CONT Queen of Navarre
1 CONT Queen consort of Sicily
1 CONT Reign 8 September 1425 – 1 April 1441
